WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Hello, my name is Elisabeth Alemneh.
And Now I'm going to demonstrate my Baletera Café Management Login System.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
When I run the program,I see three main options: User, Admin, and Exit.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Under User, I can register a new user
by entering their Student ID, full name,
phone number, and password.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Then, the system checks the information
and confirms successful registration.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Thank you!